    "Due 事件临近时，在锁屏和灵动岛显示实时倒计时。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a Due event approaches, show a live countdown on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island."
          }
